      "amount": "1/2 cup",
      "notes": "or substitute with brown sugar"
    },
    {
      "name": "all-purpose flour",
      "amount": "1/2 cup",
      "notes": "gluten-free if needed"
    },
    {
      "name": "melted butter",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons"
    },
    {
      "name": "vanilla extract",
      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "warm spices (cinnamon, nutmeg, ginger)",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "irish oatmeal",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "optional"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine sultanas, golden syrup, and melted butter. Stir until sultanas are coated.",
    "Add flour, vanilla extract, and warm spices to the bowl. Mix until well combined.",
    "If using, stir in irish oatmeal.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x9-inch casserole dish.",
    "Bake for 30-35 minutes or until the casserole is golden brown and set.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 10 minutes before serving."
